   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Rock Salt & Nails**: back after 184 archived shows (1223 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Church Street Blues**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Two Girls**: back after 220 archived shows (1375 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Lonely At The Top**: back after 233 archived shows (1417 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **If Your Hair's Too Long There's Sin In Your Heart**: back after 86 archived shows (397 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Standing In The Need Of Prayer**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Home Of The Red Fox 3000**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-03-07.mk5.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 189 min; rated 1/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones were clamped to the lower balcony rail at the venue [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-03-07.mk5.flac**: taped by A Keeping It Real Recording; source: Channel 1: Schoeps CMC1MK5 DIN (Cardioid) Right-> Zoom F8n, Channel 2: Schoeps CMC1MK5 DIN (Cardioid) Left-> Zoom F8n [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps CMC1MK5 cardioid microphones into a Zoom F8n recorder, with the source labeled as Casio DG-20 recording notes; Transfer went from SD card into Reaper, used for tracking, fades and mixing [1]",
